    "description": "In this video, Chef John makes chicken marsala milanese using dry marsala wine and mushrooms. This dinner recipe combines the buttery taste and crispy texture of a chicken cutlet with the savory yet sweet sauce of the marsala. After flattening and coating the boneless skinless chicken breasts in seasoning and bread crumbs, fry them in olive oil over medium high heat. Make the marsala sauce by combining mushrooms, dry marsala wine, flour, chicken broth, and seasoning in a pan over medium high. Pour the marsala sauce over the chicken and pair it with a bitter green salad for a rich taste and the ideal date night dinner.",
